world  self closing door

floor
  size      4 m
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.005, rolling 0.002

jamb
  is a      box 8 by 8 by 214 cm
  stands    on floor
  colour    grey

door
  is a           box 4 by 90 by 200 cm, 12 kg
  colour         wood
  bounce         dead
  raised         2 cm
